==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Doge Darks and Doges are not a problem in this stage, so bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats to deal with Shy Boy. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]] is your optimal attacker, as it deals decent damage to the peons and is strong against floating enemies.

Stacking [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] can easily [[Weaken|weaken]] Shy Boy to a point of stun-lock while your long ranged cats deal damage. [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] can help to quicken the process, but previous Forms can still work. [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] can just [[Freeze|freeze]] it long enough for your attackers to kill Shy Boy.

